             :plan "A quoted symbol in an evaluated form is reported as an auto-required namespace: `'result/x` and `'seon.sci.eval/...` (lane printer-design-opus, 2026-10-16) and `'(get-in result/e2 [])` in a test, which auto-required a namespace named `result` (lane web-chains, 2026-10-16). A quoted form is data and requires nothing. Done when the auto-require step skips symbols inside `quote`, proven by a row evaluating a quoted qualified symbol whose namespace is unloaded and asserting no require is recorded. Read the auto-require step of `seon.sci.eval` and its caller."}
